Node ID=15 slay enchanter
Text=I had hoped you would choose this path, as I have more than three hundred reasons to hate that evil fiend. But, the enchanter will be difficult to reach, with your feet of flesh. If we could find assistance, perhaps we could overcome his power.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=What kind of assistance do you mean?
Go to node ID=16 assistance
Is Default Reply=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=16 assistance
Text=While the enchanter controls most of this plane, the spirits have also gathered some power over their small regions. If another spirit decided to help us, perhaps we could shift some of the islands to form a bridge so we could reach the enchanter.
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=I'll go speak with a spirit I met and convince him to help us.
