Node ID=18 convince spirits
Text=With my limited power here, we will need to convince at *least* one other spirit to help us overcome the enchanter's influence over this plane. Once you have gained assistance, return here and I will attempt to form the bridge.
Should Have Voiceover=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=30 plane
Text=I have been here three centuries, and still I lack the words to describe this place. I have heard it referred to as a magical plane by some, and a prison by others. The enchanter formed this place as a haven for his study, but trapped himself here somehow.
