Node ID=91 dyno-mite 2
Text=Over the years, I have manifested the energy necessary to power the crystal, but I will not share it with that madman! I can use this power to complete a bridge for you to fight the enchanter *or* power the crystal so you can leave. Are you sure you wish to go?
Should Have Voiceover=1

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Maybe I *will* stay and fight this enchanter.
