Node ID=500 quips when marco turns into smart boots
Text=Fresh air! At last, to feel the sun and the wind. What a wonderful gift you have bestowed upon me, traveler.
Should Have Voiceover=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=502 quips 2
Text=Such a strange journey I have had. I've wandered from Italy to China, and now my soul continues to explore...in your sole.
Should Have Voiceover=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=504 quips 3 pyrenees
Text=Ah, the Pyrenees! Never did I think I would gaze upon these marvelous peaks again! I do hope the Knights have had the time to oust those troublesome Rock Titans.
Should Have Voiceover=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=506 persia
Text=By the taste of the sweet wind and intensity of the sun, I would gather that we've arrived in Persia. Perhaps if there is time, we could trade some of your weapons for saffron, eh?
Should Have Voiceover=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=508 general
Text=While I do appreciate that you have allowed me to explore with you, it is a true pity that even as a spirit I still retain a sense of smell...
Should Have Voiceover=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=510 barcelona general
Text=Nueva Barcelona! Bellisimo! I had always hoped to see this great city. Thank you again, Lionheart, for helping an old man explore once more.
Should Have Voiceover=1
------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=511 Boots picked up
Text=Bellisimo! I cannot wait to smell the earth and feel the grass beneath my...*your* feet.
Should Have Voiceover=1

------------------------------------------------------------
Node ID=700 Fixt spared
Text=I felt you cross my bridge, traveler, and I felt you come back with him still breathing. Three hundred years I have wanted that man dead. But I offered you the crystal myself, so I cannot curse you for taking the gentler road. Only do not ask me to forgive him.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=He has suffered enough here. So have you.
